<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">Splinter Rend</ansi>

<ansi fg="command">Splinter Rend</ansi> is used by the Glint Stalkers of the Obelisk. A Stalker slides
out of the facets beside its quarry, edge first, and leaves a sliver of
black crystal in the wound that keeps bleeding for several rounds.

<ansi fg="yellow">Counterplay: </ansi>

  A Stalker strikes once or twice and then breaks off and hides where it
  stands. It cannot leave the room. <ansi fg="command">search</ansi> for it, or be ready when it
  comes out again: it lies low for a little while before it strikes.

